Hey there! We're happy to receive all kinds of feedback and proposals in these days, and some problems will be fixed in this update. Details are as follows:

Fixed the bug that the Blueprint award might reduced by update the reputation for many times without go back to the base;
Fixed the bug that BOSS Animalert's behavior might be affected by gravity props;
Fixed the bug that some achievements like hidden room cannot be achieved;
Fixed the bug that the characters might go outside the scene at the beginning of the game.

Moreover, there are some important questions we'd like to answer:

Q: Will there be a keyboard changing system in the future?
A: We're working on it and it takes time.

Q: Are there only two chapters? When will you update the new chapters?
A: More chapters can be expected in the nearly future. And a new mode - 'Survival' will be updated in this months, August 2017.

